* SU1     2013-08-28 remove unused variables
* SU2     2013-08-28 NOMALL-1282 handle date/time if INTERVAL is active
* RAYA    2013-10-13 NOMALL-1278 creation date  for filtering
* RAYA    2013-11-05 NOMALL-1278 callnat NOARLS2N till ver 3.5
* BLI     2013-11-08 NOMALL-1278 mail-date out
* SU3     2014-04-23 NOMALL-1407 no NGC 3.3 support - remove NOARLS2N
* CF1     2014-04-29 NOMALL-1412 Correct filter for revived reports
* SU4     2014-11-12 NOMALL-1527 getting rid of coding for old versions-
*                                only restruct
* fhi     2015-05-18 NOMALL-1552 Show real size, not base64 size
* SU5     2015-06-01 NOMALL-1552 Show size 1 (instead 0)
* SU6     2015-11-23 NOMALL-1784 avoid NAT1301 (P10->B4/I4 - big ISNs)
* BLI     2016-03-01 NOMALL-1829 Check flags A R L
* BLI     2016-09-12 NOMALL-1914 Check folder-num
* CF2     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1991 General corrections and optimization
* CF3     2017-02-23 NOMALL-2000 Disable File funct. in linked folders
* SU7     2018-02-15 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* CF4     2019-01-29 NOMALL-2221 Unify grant checking
* HEB1    2020-09-28 NOMALL-2439 return error message to client/NOMLOG
* HEB2    2023-10-04 ES-34375    active help for keyword + and/or
* --------------------------------------------------------------------
*
